# One resolver per line.
# Supported formats:
#   8.8.8.8
#   1.1.1.1:5353
#   192.168.1.0/30
#   192.168.1.0/30:5353
#   [2001:4860:4860::8888]:53
#
# Line order is preserved during startup.
# When AUTO_SAVE_RANKED_RESOLVERS is enabled, the client automatically persists
# the highest-scoring resolvers in a managed header block above custom entries.

8.8.8.8

